// A done auto job past the keep cap drops. A queued job stays.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE reap ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law ROLE nanobot PROTON 1

PLUG reap law

IMPULSE reap 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "reap" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
